{
  "NEOW.talk.PUNIMOD-PUNI.0-visit": "0",
  "NEOW.talk.PUNIMOD-PUNI.0-0r.ancient": "[sine]……醒来……\n……陌生的……圣灵……[/sine]",
  "NEOW.talk.PUNIMOD-PUNI.0-0r.next": "继续",
  "NEOW.talk.PUNIMOD-PUNI.0-1r.char": "这里……不是我沉睡的地方。",
  "NEOW.talk.PUNIMOD-PUNI.0-1r.next": "继续",
  "NEOW.talk.PUNIMOD-PUNI.0-2r.ancient": "[sine]……这里……需要……你的光……[/sine]",
  "NEOW.talk.PUNIMOD-PUNI.0-2r.next": "继续",
  "NEOW.talk.PUNIMOD-PUNI.0-3r.char": "先告诉我，我要去哪里。",
  "NEOW.talk.PUNIMOD-PUNI.1-visit": "1",
  "NEOW.talk.PUNIMOD-PUNI.1-0r.ancient": "[sine]……封印……又……回来了……[/sine]",
  "NEOW.talk.PUNIMOD-PUNI.1-0r.next": "继续",
  "NEOW.talk.PUNIMOD-PUNI.1-1r.char": "每次醒来，它们都会恢复。",
  "NEOW.talk.PUNIMOD-PUNI.1-1r.next": "继续",
  "NEOW.talk.PUNIMOD-PUNI.1-2r.ancient": "[sine]……你……也会……[/sine]",
  "NEOW.talk.PUNIMOD-PUNI.1-2r.next": "继续",
  "NEOW.talk.PUNIMOD-PUNI.1-3r.char": "我知道。让它们再开一次。",
  "NEOW.talk.PUNIMOD-PUNI.2-visit": "2",
  "NEOW.talk.PUNIMOD-PUNI.2-0r.char": "你一直在等我？",
  "NEOW.talk.PUNIMOD-PUNI.2-0r.next": "继续",
  "NEOW.talk.PUNIMOD-PUNI.2-1r.ancient": "[sine]……不止……你……[/sine]",
  "NEOW.talk.PUNIMOD-PUNI.2-1r.next": "继续",
  "NEOW.talk.PUNIMOD-PUNI.2-2r.char": "还有多少人？",
  "NEOW.talk.PUNIMOD-PUNI.2-2r.next": "继续",
  "NEOW.talk.PUNIMOD-PUNI.2-3r.ancient": "[sine]……继续……往上……[/sine]",
  "DARV.talk.PUNIMOD-PUNI.0-visit": "0",
  "DARV.talk.PUNIMOD-PUNI.0-0r.ancient": "哎呀！你一来，我这堆宝贝都亮起来啦！",
  "DARV.talk.PUNIMOD-PUNI.0-0r.next": "继续",
  "DARV.talk.PUNIMOD-PUNI.0-1r.char": "只是光照在上面。",
  "DARV.talk.PUNIMOD-PUNI.0-1r.next": "继续",
  "DARV.talk.PUNIMOD-PUNI.0-2r.ancient": "那也不错！我终于能找东西了。来，你先挑！",
  "DARV.talk.PUNIMOD-PUNI.1-visit": "1",
  "DARV.talk.PUNIMOD-PUNI.1-0r.char": "这块石头，你上次也拿给我看过。",
  "DARV.talk.PUNIMOD-PUNI.1-0r.next": "继续",
  "DARV.talk.PUNIMOD-PUNI.1-1r.ancient": "是吗？那你上次带走没有？",
  "DARV.talk.PUNIMOD-PUNI.1-1r.next": "继续",
  "DARV.talk.PUNIMOD-PUNI.1-2r.char": "没有。",
  "DARV.talk.PUNIMOD-PUNI.1-2r.next": "继续",
  "DARV.talk.PUNIMOD-PUNI.1-3r.ancient": "那它肯定一直在等你！",
  "DARV.talk.PUNIMOD-PUNI.2-visit": "2",
  "DARV.talk.PUNIMOD-PUNI.2-0r.ancient": "让我找找……有件东西，金色的，还会发亮……",
  "DARV.talk.PUNIMOD-PUNI.2-0r.next": "继续",
  "DARV.talk.PUNIMOD-PUNI.2-1r.char": "你在看我。",
  "DARV.talk.PUNIMOD-PUNI.2-1r.next": "继续",
  "DARV.talk.PUNIMOD-PUNI.2-2r.ancient": "噢！难怪怎么也拿不起来。",
  "OROBAS.talk.PUNIMOD-PUNI.0-visit": "0",
  "OROBAS.talk.PUNIMOD-PUNI.0-0r.ancient": "从上面来的？下面来的？外面的？！",
  "OROBAS.talk.PUNIMOD-PUNI.0-0r.next": "继续",
  "OROBAS.talk.PUNIMOD-PUNI.0-1r.char": "很远的地方。",
  "OROBAS.talk.PUNIMOD-PUNI.0-1r.next": "继续",
  "OROBAS.talk.PUNIMOD-PUNI.0-2r.ancient": "多远？这么远？这么——远？！",
  "OROBAS.talk.PUNIMOD-PUNI.0-2r.next": "继续",
  "OROBAS.talk.PUNIMOD-PUNI.0-3r.char": "还要再远一些。",
  "OROBAS.talk.PUNIMOD-PUNI.0-3r.next": "继续",
  "OROBAS.talk.PUNIMOD-PUNI.0-4r.ancient": "好远！拿个东西！路上用！！",
  "OROBAS.talk.PUNIMOD-PUNI.1-visit": "1",
  "OROBAS.talk.PUNIMOD-PUNI.1-0r.ancient": "锁！你身上有锁的味道！！",
  "OROBAS.talk.PUNIMOD-PUNI.1-0r.next": "继续",
  "OROBAS.talk.PUNIMOD-PUNI.1-1r.char": "是封印。",
  "OROBAS.talk.PUNIMOD-PUNI.1-1r.next": "继续",
  "OROBAS.talk.PUNIMOD-PUNI.1-2r.ancient": "钥匙呢？钥匙丢了？！",
  "OROBAS.talk.PUNIMOD-PUNI.1-2r.next": "继续",
  "OROBAS.talk.PUNIMOD-PUNI.1-3r.char": "不需要钥匙。",
  "OROBAS.talk.PUNIMOD-PUNI.1-3r.next": "继续",
  "OROBAS.talk.PUNIMOD-PUNI.1-4r.ancient": "真方便！！",
  "OROBAS.talk.PUNIMOD-PUNI.2-visit": "2",
  "OROBAS.talk.PUNIMOD-PUNI.2-0r.ancient": "这个！给你！会变厉害！！",
  "OROBAS.talk.PUNIMOD-PUNI.2-0r.next": "继续",
  "OROBAS.talk.PUNIMOD-PUNI.2-1r.char": "你知道它会改变什么吗？",
  "OROBAS.talk.PUNIMOD-PUNI.2-1r.next": "继续",
  "OROBAS.talk.PUNIMOD-PUNI.2-2r.ancient": "不知道！试试就知道！！",
  "OROBAS.talk.PUNIMOD-PUNI.2-2r.next": "继续",
  "OROBAS.talk.PUNIMOD-PUNI.2-3r.char": "……我先看看。",
  "PAEL.talk.PUNIMOD-PUNI.0-visit": "0",
  "PAEL.talk.PUNIMOD-PUNI.0-0r.ancient": "[thinky_dots]太亮了……把光收一收……[/thinky_dots]",
  "PAEL.talk.PUNIMOD-PUNI.0-0r.next": "继续",
  "PAEL.talk.PUNIMOD-PUNI.0-1r.char": "这样呢？",
  "PAEL.talk.PUNIMOD-PUNI.0-1r.next": "继续",
  "PAEL.talk.PUNIMOD-PUNI.0-2r.ancient": "[thinky_dots]嗯……拿点东西……轻些走……[/thinky_dots]",
  "PAEL.talk.PUNIMOD-PUNI.1-visit": "1",
  "PAEL.talk.PUNIMOD-PUNI.1-0r.char": "你受伤了吗？",
  "PAEL.talk.PUNIMOD-PUNI.1-0r.next": "继续",
  "PAEL.talk.PUNIMOD-PUNI.1-1r.ancient": "[thinky_dots]没有……只是累……一直都很累……[/thinky_dots]",
  "PAEL.talk.PUNIMOD-PUNI.1-1r.next": "继续",
  "PAEL.talk.PUNIMOD-PUNI.1-2r.char": "需要我留下吗？",
  "PAEL.talk.PUNIMOD-PUNI.1-2r.next": "继续",
  "PAEL.talk.PUNIMOD-PUNI.1-3r.ancient": "[thinky_dots]不用……替我看看父亲吧……[/thinky_dots]",
  "PAEL.talk.PUNIMOD-PUNI.2-visit": "2",
  "PAEL.talk.PUNIMOD-PUNI.2-0r.ancient": "[i][font_size=22]佩尔睡得很沉。[/font_size][/i]",
  "PAEL.talk.PUNIMOD-PUNI.2-0r.next": "继续",
  "PAEL.talk.PUNIMOD-PUNI.2-1r.char": "……我下次再来。",
  "PAEL.talk.PUNIMOD-PUNI.2-1r.next": "继续",
  "PAEL.talk.PUNIMOD-PUNI.2-2r.ancient": "[thinky_dots]既然来了……就带一点走……[/thinky_dots]",
  "PAEL.talk.PUNIMOD-PUNI.2-2r.next": "继续",
  "PAEL.talk.PUNIMOD-PUNI.2-3r.char": "你还醒着？",
  "PAEL.talk.PUNIMOD-PUNI.2-3r.next": "继续",
  "PAEL.talk.PUNIMOD-PUNI.2-4r.ancient": "[thinky_dots]……刚才没有……[/thinky_dots]",
  "NONUPEIPE.talk.PUNIMOD-PUNI.0-visit": "0",
  "NONUPEIPE.talk.PUNIMOD-PUNI.0-0r.ancient": "多好看的金色！近一点，让我看看。",
  "NONUPEIPE.talk.PUNIMOD-PUNI.0-0r.next": "继续",
  "NONUPEIPE.talk.PUNIMOD-PUNI.0-1r.char": "你想看什么？",
  "NONUPEIPE.talk.PUNIMOD-PUNI.0-1r.next": "继续",
  "NONUPEIPE.talk.PUNIMOD-PUNI.0-2r.ancient": "这些纹样……嗯，别动，我已经有主意了。",
  "NONUPEIPE.talk.PUNIMOD-PUNI.0-2r.next": "继续",
  "NONUPEIPE.talk.PUNIMOD-PUNI.0-3r.char": "我只是路过。",
  "NONUPEIPE.talk.PUNIMOD-PUNI.0-3r.next": "继续",
  "NONUPEIPE.talk.PUNIMOD-PUNI.0-4r.ancient": "那更要抓紧。",
  "NONUPEIPE.talk.PUNIMOD-PUNI.1-visit": "1",
  "NONUPEIPE.talk.PUNIMOD-PUNI.1-0r.ancient": "上次给你的东西，穿着还合适吗？",
  "NONUPEIPE.talk.PUNIMOD-PUNI.1-0r.next": "继续",
  "NONUPEIPE.talk.PUNIMOD-PUNI.1-1r.char": "它挡住了一次本该落在我身上的攻击。",
  "NONUPEIPE.talk.PUNIMOD-PUNI.1-1r.next": "继续",
  "NONUPEIPE.talk.PUNIMOD-PUNI.1-2r.ancient": "那就很合适。来，这次再试一件。",
  "NONUPEIPE.talk.PUNIMOD-PUNI.2-visit": "2",
  "NONUPEIPE.talk.PUNIMOD-PUNI.2-0r.char": "这些不是饰物，不能摘下来。",
  "NONUPEIPE.talk.PUNIMOD-PUNI.2-0r.next": "继续",
  "NONUPEIPE.talk.PUNIMOD-PUNI.2-1r.ancient": "我看得出来。你的衣服得顺着它们做。",
  "NONUPEIPE.talk.PUNIMOD-PUNI.2-1r.next": "继续",
  "NONUPEIPE.talk.PUNIMOD-PUNI.2-2r.char": "你不觉得麻烦？",
  "NONUPEIPE.talk.PUNIMOD-PUNI.2-2r.next": "继续",
  "NONUPEIPE.talk.PUNIMOD-PUNI.2-3r.ancient": "难得有这样的客人，怎么会麻烦？",
  "TANX.talk.PUNIMOD-PUNI.0-visit": "0",
  "TANX.talk.PUNIMOD-PUNI.0-0r.ancient": "[b]没有剑！没有斧！你拿什么打？！[/b]",
  "TANX.talk.PUNIMOD-PUNI.0-0r.next": "继续",
  "TANX.talk.PUNIMOD-PUNI.0-1r.char": "你想试试？",
  "TANX.talk.PUNIMOD-PUNI.0-1r.next": "继续",
  "TANX.talk.PUNIMOD-PUNI.0-2r.ancient": "[b]想！！但先把这件拿上！[/b]",
  "TANX.talk.PUNIMOD-PUNI.1-visit": "1",
  "TANX.talk.PUNIMOD-PUNI.1-0r.ancient": "[b]你又来了！这次够强了吗？！[/b]",
  "TANX.talk.PUNIMOD-PUNI.1-0r.next": "继续",
  "TANX.talk.PUNIMOD-PUNI.1-1r.char": "比上次强一些。",
  "TANX.talk.PUNIMOD-PUNI.1-1r.next": "继续",
  "TANX.talk.PUNIMOD-PUNI.1-2r.ancient": "[b]一些不够！还要更强！！[/b]",
  "TANX.talk.PUNIMOD-PUNI.1-2r.next": "继续",
  "TANX.talk.PUNIMOD-PUNI.1-3r.char": "那就再借我一件武器。",
  "TANX.talk.PUNIMOD-PUNI.2-visit": "2",
  "TANX.talk.PUNIMOD-PUNI.2-0r.char": "这里没有地方能让我们放开手脚。",
  "TANX.talk.PUNIMOD-PUNI.2-0r.next": "继续",
  "TANX.talk.PUNIMOD-PUNI.2-1r.ancient": "[b]那就把挡路的东西全打碎！！[/b]",
  "TANX.talk.PUNIMOD-PUNI.2-1r.next": "继续",
  "TANX.talk.PUNIMOD-PUNI.2-2r.char": "包括你的武器架？",
  "TANX.talk.PUNIMOD-PUNI.2-2r.next": "继续",
  "TANX.talk.PUNIMOD-PUNI.2-3r.ancient": "[b]……换个地方！！[/b]",
  "TEZCATARA.talk.PUNIMOD-PUNI.0-visit": "0",
  "TEZCATARA.talk.PUNIMOD-PUNI.0-0r.ancient": "哎呀，亲爱的，自己就会发光！真漂亮。",
  "TEZCATARA.talk.PUNIMOD-PUNI.0-0r.next": "继续",
  "TEZCATARA.talk.PUNIMOD-PUNI.0-1r.char": "你这里很热。",
  "TEZCATARA.talk.PUNIMOD-PUNI.0-1r.next": "继续",
  "TEZCATARA.talk.PUNIMOD-PUNI.0-2r.ancient": "马上还会更热。站好，让我看看你哪里需要修一修。",
  "TEZCATARA.talk.PUNIMOD-PUNI.1-visit": "1",
  "TEZCATARA.talk.PUNIMOD-PUNI.1-0r.ancient": "今天想烧掉什么，亲爱的？",
  "TEZCATARA.talk.PUNIMOD-PUNI.1-0r.next": "继续",
  "TEZCATARA.talk.PUNIMOD-PUNI.1-1r.char": "有些力量，还被封印压着。",
  "TEZCATARA.talk.PUNIMOD-PUNI.1-1r.next": "继续",
  "TEZCATARA.talk.PUNIMOD-PUNI.1-2r.ancient": "你想让我[jitter][b]烧掉[/b][/jitter]封印？",
  "TEZCATARA.talk.PUNIMOD-PUNI.1-2r.next": "继续",
  "TEZCATARA.talk.PUNIMOD-PUNI.1-3r.char": "先别点火。我还没说完。",
  "TEZCATARA.talk.PUNIMOD-PUNI.1-3r.next": "继续",
  "TEZCATARA.talk.PUNIMOD-PUNI.1-4r.ancient": "呵呵，那你可得说快些。",
  "TEZCATARA.talk.PUNIMOD-PUNI.2-visit": "2",
  "TEZCATARA.talk.PUNIMOD-PUNI.2-0r.char": "上次的火，留了很久。",
  "TEZCATARA.talk.PUNIMOD-PUNI.2-0r.next": "继续",
  "TEZCATARA.talk.PUNIMOD-PUNI.2-1r.ancient": "是吗？你喜欢？",
  "TEZCATARA.talk.PUNIMOD-PUNI.2-1r.next": "继续",
  "TEZCATARA.talk.PUNIMOD-PUNI.2-2r.char": "我没有这么说。",
  "TEZCATARA.talk.PUNIMOD-PUNI.2-2r.next": "继续",
  "TEZCATARA.talk.PUNIMOD-PUNI.2-3r.ancient": "别害羞，亲爱的。我还有更旺的！",
  "VAKUU.talk.PUNIMOD-PUNI.0-visit": "0",
  "VAKUU.talk.PUNIMOD-PUNI.0-0r.ancient": "一个星间来客。你也找到这里了。",
  "VAKUU.talk.PUNIMOD-PUNI.0-0r.next": "继续",
  "VAKUU.talk.PUNIMOD-PUNI.0-1r.char": "你见过和我一样的生命？",
  "VAKUU.talk.PUNIMOD-PUNI.0-1r.next": "继续",
  "VAKUU.talk.PUNIMOD-PUNI.0-2r.ancient": "我见过许多想从这里出去的生命。",
  "VAKUU.talk.PUNIMOD-PUNI.0-2r.next": "继续",
  "VAKUU.talk.PUNIMOD-PUNI.0-3r.char": "那就谈谈你能给的帮助。",
  "VAKUU.talk.PUNIMOD-PUNI.1-visit": "1",
  "VAKUU.talk.PUNIMOD-PUNI.1-0r.ancient": "你身上的封印，究竟在防备谁？",
  "VAKUU.talk.PUNIMOD-PUNI.1-0r.next": "继续",
  "VAKUU.talk.PUNIMOD-PUNI.1-1r.char": "你对它们很感兴趣。",
  "VAKUU.talk.PUNIMOD-PUNI.1-1r.next": "继续",
  "VAKUU.talk.PUNIMOD-PUNI.1-2r.ancient": "力量总能让我感兴趣。",
  "VAKUU.talk.PUNIMOD-PUNI.1-2r.next": "继续",
  "VAKUU.talk.PUNIMOD-PUNI.1-3r.char": "那你最好先把交易的代价说清楚。",
  "VAKUU.talk.PUNIMOD-PUNI.2-visit": "2",
  "VAKUU.talk.PUNIMOD-PUNI.2-0r.ancient": "又一次。你还没有厌倦？",
  "VAKUU.talk.PUNIMOD-PUNI.2-0r.next": "继续",
  "VAKUU.talk.PUNIMOD-PUNI.2-1r.char": "你每次都问。",
  "VAKUU.talk.PUNIMOD-PUNI.2-1r.next": "继续",
  "VAKUU.talk.PUNIMOD-PUNI.2-2r.ancient": "我有耐心。也许下一次，你就愿意把自己交给我了。",
  "VAKUU.talk.PUNIMOD-PUNI.2-2r.next": "继续",
  "VAKUU.talk.PUNIMOD-PUNI.2-3r.char": "这一次，仍然不会。",
  "THE_ARCHITECT.talk.PUNIMOD-PUNI.0-visit": "0",
  "THE_ARCHITECT.talk.PUNIMOD-PUNI.0-endattack": "Architect",
  "THE_ARCHITECT.talk.PUNIMOD-PUNI.0-0r.ancient": "七道封印尽解。你终于走到了这里。",
  "THE_ARCHITECT.talk.PUNIMOD-PUNI.0-0r.next": "继续",
  "THE_ARCHITECT.talk.PUNIMOD-PUNI.0-1r.char": "我曾以为，塔顶便是轮回的尽头。",
  "THE_ARCHITECT.talk.PUNIMOD-PUNI.0-1r.next": "继续",
  "THE_ARCHITECT.talk.PUNIMOD-PUNI.0-2r.ancient": "你看见了。塔顶只是下一次开始。",
  "THE_ARCHITECT.talk.PUNIMOD-PUNI.0-2r.next": "继续",
  "THE_ARCHITECT.talk.PUNIMOD-PUNI.0-3r.char": "那些倒在塔中的生命，也会回来吗？",
  "THE_ARCHITECT.talk.PUNIMOD-PUNI.0-3r.next": "继续",
  "THE_ARCHITECT.talk.PUNIMOD-PUNI.0-4r.ancient": "会。然后再次倒下。你也一样。",
  "THE_ARCHITECT.talk.PUNIMOD-PUNI.0-4r.next": "继续",
  "THE_ARCHITECT.talk.PUNIMOD-PUNI.0-5r.char": "他们会记得什么？",
  "THE_ARCHITECT.talk.PUNIMOD-PUNI.0-5r.next": "继续",
  "THE_ARCHITECT.talk.PUNIMOD-PUNI.0-6r.ancient": "很少。也许是一场梦，也许只是一道伤痕。",
  "THE_ARCHITECT.talk.PUNIMOD-PUNI.0-6r.next": "继续",
  "THE_ARCHITECT.talk.PUNIMOD-PUNI.0-7r.char": "那就让他们记得光。",
  "THE_ARCHITECT.talk.PUNIMOD-PUNI.0-7r.next": "继续",
  "THE_ARCHITECT.talk.PUNIMOD-PUNI.0-8r.ancient": "你准备为此重来多少次？",
  "THE_ARCHITECT.talk.PUNIMOD-PUNI.0-8r.next": "继续",
  "THE_ARCHITECT.talk.PUNIMOD-PUNI.0-9r.char": "直到他们不必再来。",
  "THE_ARCHITECT.talk.PUNIMOD-PUNI.1-visit": "1",
  "THE_ARCHITECT.talk.PUNIMOD-PUNI.1-endattack": "Architect",
  "THE_ARCHITECT.talk.PUNIMOD-PUNI.1-0r.ancient": "你又到了这里。",
  "THE_ARCHITECT.talk.PUNIMOD-PUNI.1-0r.next": "继续",
  "THE_ARCHITECT.talk.PUNIMOD-PUNI.1-1r.char": "路上的生命，又死了一次。",
  "THE_ARCHITECT.talk.PUNIMOD-PUNI.1-1r.next": "继续",
  "THE_ARCHITECT.talk.PUNIMOD-PUNI.1-2r.ancient": "你救不了每一个。",
